{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>They called them</b> — the sense is: <b>from Egypt I called My sons</b> (Hosea 11:1) to serve Me, and now they called to them to the Baals. And just as they called to them to the Baals, so they went and wandered from their land because of them. And some say: my prophets called them, and they walked backward."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:51.904907925Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}